  "formula": "direct/m3 = conc_price[grade]*(1+2%) + steel_kg/1000*(2850*(1+3%) + fixing) + formwork_m2_m3*formwork_rate_m2 + placing_m3 + extras_m3 ; sell = direct*(1+markup_pct/100)",
  "notes": "Derived from sheet 'تحليل الأسعار' of the Makeen 100 R1 internal workbook. concrete_price_m3 = sheet concrete column / 1.02 (exact for every row: C20 234.6→230, C40 306→300, C45 351.9→345, C50 341.7→335, C50 for retaining/tank walls 372.3→365 [sulphate-resisting/waterproof mix, keyed C50_SRC], C60 SCC 438.6→430). steel fixing = steel column/(kg/1000) − 2,935.5: 640 SAR/t for walls & columns (retaining, podium/core walls, all columns), 560 SAR/t for raft, tank walls, beams, slabs, ramps, stairs. formwork_rate_m2 = formwork column / formwork ratio per row. Wall/column types carry a podium variant because the sheet uses different formwork ratios/rates there; core walls/columns use mid-value extras (sheet: 40/25 walls, 50/30 columns). Lightweight fill is an all-in 350/m3. WARNING: the sheet's sell rates are NOT direct×1.10 — 17 of 20 rows sell BELOW direct cost (e.g. raft 945 vs 1,012.7); apply markup_pct deliberately when reusing."
